      "id": 1,
      "text": "Stem grew around a new rail station built by Richmond and Danville Railroad, and the town was founded in 1888 by William Thomas Stem.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        10,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
